<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Finance gets SES nod to list shares.</title>
<headline>Keppel Finance gets SES nod to list shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Finance Ltd, part of Keppel Corp, said on Thursday the Stock Exchange of Singapore has approved its listing of five million new ordinary placement shares of S$0.50 each.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Keppel Securities Ptd Ltd has been appointed as placement agent to procure subscriptions for the shares at S$1.68 each.</p>
<p>On October 21, the company said it intended to use the proceeds to finance redevelopment of its branch at Carpenter Street in Singapore into its head office.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
